    t7  | 9102    | wrist       | electric   | mechanical                    | any       | "9102.11" | "With mechanical display only: 9102.11"
    t8  | 9102    | wrist       | electric   | opto-electronic               | any       | "9102.12" | "With opto-electronic display only: 9102.12"
